{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t熱帶氣旋薔琵減弱為颱風，內地中央氣象台維持發布藍色預警，預料薔琵今天上午移入東海南部海域，不排除明天掠過浙江沿海。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n受到薔琵影響，預計台灣中北部、浙江東北部等地，部分地區有暴雨。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：盧曉珊\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T23:03:32.680477+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":96,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 大中華","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T22:26:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T01:58:28.131735+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T22:57:56.172309+00:00","content_hash":"79c68021582a57dfbf1778c28beaae40b7f5dbeb30362b6a51cdefed6801bd52","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}